/*
 * VL53L1X Time-of-Flight Distance Sensor with Buzzer Alert
 * Board:  Raspberry Pi 4 Model B
 * Library: pigpio (modern API, no wiringPi)
 *
 * Wiring:
 *   VL53L1X SDA -> GPIO 2 (I2C bus 1 SDA)
 *   VL53L1X SCL -> GPIO 3 (I2C bus 1 SCL)
 *   VL53L1X VDD -> 3.3 V
 *   VL53L1X GND -> GND
 *   Buzzer +    -> GPIO 22 (active-high)
